ading in a non-base currency may instead come from the client\'s own bank.', 'inactivity_fee' => 'Reports conflict on the exact mechanic -- one source cites $15 after 12 months of inactivity, another suggests $15 per month for dormant accounts. Verify the exact current policy on FOREX.com\'s own fee schedule before relying on either figure.', 'customer_service_note' => 'Strong Trustpilot showing, around 4.7/5 from roughly 2,000-2,400 reviews (about 84% five-star), with FOREX.com reportedly responding to nearly all negative reviews within 24 hours; a minority of reviewers report slower or less helpful service.', 'mobile_note' => 'One independent review scored the mobile app 10/10 for its charting depth (80+ indicators, 11 chart types), though this is an editorial review score rather than a numeric App Store or Google Play star rating, which wasn\'t found in this research pass.', 'education_note' => 'Reviewed as a strong educational offering for beginners, with independent commentary citing its tutorials and overall educational content favorably.', 'blurb' => 'Backed by NASDAQ-listed StoneX Group; strong educational content and platform variety.', 'scores' => array( 'regulation' => 3.4, 'cost' => 4.58, 'platforms' => 4.2, 'track_record' => 2.96, 'overall' => 3.83 ), 'rank' => 6 ),
